OL,3,GNEWSAWoman charged after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 27-year-old woman has been charged
OL,7,Fafter a police officer was shot in
OL,8,FNottingham city centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,11,Fwas shot in the foot after he
OL,12,Fapproached a man and a woman at a bus
OL,13,Fstop in Angel Row shortly before 04:50
OL,14,FBST on Sunday.
OL,16,FThe male officer remains in hospital
OL,17,Freceiving treatment, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
