OL,3,GNEWSAWoman charged after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FAisha Zaman, of Collison Street, Hyson
OL,7,FGreen, has been charged with possession
OL,8,Fof a prohibited firearm and possession
OL,9,Fof that firearm with intent to commit
OL,10,Fan indictable offence.
